moment nobody cares,

00:49:56.690 --> 00:50:00.560
that Doug cares, Dr. Addy
cares, Dr. Alfiee cares,

00:50:00.560 --> 00:50:03.890
and you are seen, you are
valued, and you are heard.

00:50:03.890 --> 00:50:05.390
We just need you to know that.

00:50:07.280 --> 00:50:08.290
- You're never alone.

00:50:08.290 --> 00:50:10.265
That's what I was telling.

00:50:10.265 --> 00:50:11.223
You're never alone.

00:50:11.223 --> 00:50:12.577
You have so many people
that care about you.

00:50:12.577 --> 00:50:16.253
And just find a good support
system to put around you.

00:50:17.270 --> 00:50:19.830
That way if you're ever struggling,

00:50:19.830 --> 00:50:21.440
if you ever have a tough day,

00:50:21.440 --> 00:50:22.990
you have some people that can recognize

00:50:22.990 --> 00:50:24.540
that you're going through that

00:50:24.540 --> 00:50:27.580
and be there to help
you get you through it.

00:50:27.580 --> 00:50:29.830
- So good, so good.

00:50:29.830 --> 00:50:31.160
Well, I'm indebted to both of you.

00:50:31.160 --> 00:50:32.950
Thanks again for jumping on the Addy Hour.

